/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 45 0 R
/T (MHz clock from the input oscillator, a custom clock-divider module \(clock_divider\) producing the 1 Hz enable/clock, and the 3-bit counter module \(counter\) whose output drives the LEDs. The active-low reset \(rst_n\) is distributed to the PLL reset and, through the PLL locked signal, gates the reset of the downstream clock divider and counter.)
/E (MHz clock from the input oscillator, a custom clock-divider module \(clock_divider\) producing the 1 Hz enable/clock, and the 3-bit counter module \(counter\) whose output drives the LEDs. The active-low reset \(rst_n\) is distributed to the PLL reset and, through the PLL locked signal, gates the reset of the downstream clock divider and counter.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
