/E (The design was implemented and verified on a ZedBoard development board, which is built around the Xilinx/AMD XC7Z020CLG484-2 Zynq-7000 SoC device. The corresponding board-level I/O physical constraints file \(Master XDC\) provided by Avnet/Digilent for the ZedBoard was used and adapted for this design.)
