273 0 obj
<<
/Title (1. Objective The goal of this assignment is to implement a 3-bit counter driven by a 1 Hz clock signal. The clock originates from the FPGA's internal oscillator, is fed into a Phase-Locked Loop \(PLL\) that generates an 8 MHz output clock, and is then divided down to 1 Hz using a clock divider module. Running the counter at such a slow clock rate allows its state transitions to be observed visually on the on-board FPGA LEDs.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 178 0 R
>>
endobj
