/Title (MHz clock from the input oscillator, a custom clock-divider module \(clock_divider\) producing the 1 Hz enable/clock, and the 3-bit counter module \(counter\) whose output drives the LEDs. The active-low reset \(rst_n\) is distributed to the PLL reset and, through the PLL locked signal, gates the reset of the downstream clock divider and counter.)
