/Title (Divides the 8 MHz PLL output clock down to 1 Hz by toggling clk_out every 4,000,000 input clock cycles \(a 22-bit counter counting from 0 to 3,999,999\), giving a full toggle period of 8,000,000 cycles at 8 MHz, i.e. 1 Hz.)
