/Title (A primary 100 MHz clock constraint was applied to the input clk port, and a generated clock constraint was derived on the PLL output \(U_pll/clk_out1\) at the 8 MHz rate. False-path constraints were applied from the asynchronous reset \(rst_n\) to the counter's clear inputs, and from the counter register clock pins to the counter output ports, since these paths are not timing-critical single-bit toggle observations.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 401 0 R
